+#  2. ✓ PASS 64x128x64 R128 stages=2                  max_diff=0.092
+#  3. ✓ PASS 128x128x64 R64 stages=2                  max_diff=0.088
+#  4. ✓ PASS 128x128x64 R128 stages=2                 max_diff=0.091
