+
+### Tier 2 Success Criteria
+
+✅ Clean GEMM passes for all tile configurations  
+✅ Full NoisyGEMM passes (noising + GEMM + denoising)  
+✅ No correctness failures (max_diff < 0.1 for FP16)  
+✅ No SMEM overflow errors
